into `2*sigma_eta(t)^(-2)*dot{s}(t)^(-1)*alpha^(-1)`.
-/
theorem generalMovingTargetDiscreteResidualCoefficientRewriteScalar
    (dotS dotT sigmaInvSq alphaInv : Real)
    (hdotT : dotT = dotS⁻¹)
    (hdotS : dotS ≠ 0) :
