/-- Post-DV scalar handoff for the continuous general VA-SALD coefficient.

This is the `appendix.tex:885-907` real/order step after the analytic DV
backend has supplied
`alpha * energy <= K + log E_pi exp(alpha * energy)`.  It rewrites the
pre-DV residual-energy term into the exact Gronwall coefficient
`damping - coeff * alpha^(-1)` and residual `coeff * E_alpha`.  It does not
