        (sigmaInvSq * dotS⁻¹) * alpha⁻¹) * kl) +
        (sigmaInvSq * dotS⁻¹) * eAlpha := by
  exact generalMovingTargetPostDvGronwallCoefficientScalar
    dKdt kl ((sigmaSq / 2) * dotS * cLSI) alpha residualSq logMgf eAlpha
    (sigmaInvSq * dotS⁻¹) hpre halpha hcoeff hdv heAlpha

